# Generated graphify knowledge-graph artifacts.
#
# linguist-generated collapses them in PR review and keeps them out of the
# repo's language stats. `-diff` stops git from rendering a textual diff:
# Louvain clustering is nondeterministic, so a rebuild that finds no code
# changes still rewrites ~80% of graph.json's community assignments, and an
# unsuppressed refresh buries the real diff under thousands of meaningless lines.
graphify-out/** linguist-generated=true
graphify-out/graph.json -diff
graphify-out/graph.html -diff
graphify-out/manifest.json -diff
